releasetools: tolerate a partition missing from target files

_ReadPartitionPropFile() is documented to return '' when not found but indexed
partition_map[name] unconditionally, so BUILD_WITHOUT_VENDOR targets (prebuilt
stock vendor) crashed make_recovery_patch with KeyError: 'vendor'.

 tools/releasetools/common.py | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

